    "body": "The comment documenting the costs and precomputed table size of \\ECMULT_WINDOW_SIZE\\ in \\src/ecmult_impl.h\\ resided directly under \\#define WINDOW_A 5\\ and referenced \\WINDOW_G\\. This became lingering and out of context when \\ecmult_context\\ was removed in 6815761cf5500f1a619965c5b4bbc8918b334a35.\n\n- Move the documentation comment to \\src/ecmult.h\\ directly preceding \\#ifndef ECMULT_WINDOW_SIZE\\.\n- Use \\ECMULT_TABLE_SIZE(ECMULT_WINDOW_SIZE)\\ for the table size formula instead of referencing \\WINDOW_G\\.\n- Update the boundary comments (\\> 27\\ and \\> 31\\) in \\src/ecmult.h\\ to refer to \\ECMULT_WINDOW_SIZE\\ rather than \\WINDOW_G\\.\n\nCloses #1766.",
